            ^"Size" STRING "Major"
            ^"Category" STRING "Supernatural"
            ^"Source" STRING "Against the Dark"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 134
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Choosing this Virtue gives the character the Slay Art with an initial score of 0. Slay is a Difficult Art, meaning that it is treated as any other Art except that it uses the Ability Advancement Table rather than the Art Advancement Table. The Slay Art must be combined with at least one (Foe) Art to be used."
    }

